name: opns-rns-post-bridge
version: __VERSION__
origin: net/opns-rns-post-bridge
comment: Reticulum Network Stack Daemon bridge for OPNSense
maintainer: reticulum@retichat.com
www: https://reticulum.network
prefix: /usr/local
desc: |
  rnsd (Rust implementation) packaged as an OPNSense plugin.
  
  This daemon bridges the Reticulum-PHP PostInterface backbone
  to a local Reticulum mesh via a high-speed BackboneInterface.
  
  Features:
  - PostInterface HTTP exchange client (polls PHP nodes)
  - BackboneInterface TCP server (serves LAN RNS nodes)
  - Web UI configuration integrated into OPNSense
  - Managed via rc.d service

deps:
  libc
  libcrypto
  libssl;
